# Dispatcher set 1 — Asterisk backends.
# Format: setid destination flags priority attrs
#
# Phase 1: two Asterisk nodes. Kamailio probes both every 30s via
# SIP OPTIONS (ds_ping_interval=30 in kamailio.cfg); unreachable
# backends get dropped from rotation automatically. Selection is
# ds_select_dst("1", "0") — algo 0 = hash over Call-ID, so in-
# dialog traffic stays pinned to one node and a mid-call failover
# would drop the call (acceptable per TODO.md).
#
# Both names resolve via docker DNS on the telephony network.
# Production replaces these with real VM hostnames.
#
# Flags: 0 = no special flags
# Priority: 0 = equal (both picked equally by hash)
# Attrs: weight=100
1 sip:asterisk-1:5060 0 0 weight=100
1 sip:asterisk-2:5060 0 0 weight=100
